  "description": "Bring a playful explosion of color to your projects with the Super Graffiti font, a “bubbly and bold” cartoon typeface that is all about fun.\nThis Super Graffiti typeface features thick, pillowy letterforms and smooth curves that are reminiscent of classic bubble-style street art. It is the go-to Super Graffiti font for children’s party banners, toy store logos, and vibrant candy packaging.\nThe friendly, approachable nature of the Super Graffiti typeface makes it perfect for targeting a younger audience. Its “Super” presence works best with bright rainbow gradients and bold black outlines.\nPair the Super Graffiti font with playful character illustrations to create a complete world of fun. Whether you’re designing a YouTube banner or a school event poster, this font guarantees a “super” impact.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Bring a playful explosion of color to your projects with the Super Graffiti font, a “bubbly and bold” cartoon typeface that is all about fun.</strong></p>\n<p>This Super Graffiti typeface features thick, pillowy letterforms and smooth curves that are reminiscent of classic bubble-style street art. It is the go-to Super Graffiti font for children’s party banners, toy store logos, and vibrant candy packaging.</p>\n<p>The friendly, approachable nature of the Super Graffiti typeface makes it perfect for targeting a younger audience. Its “Super” presence works best with bright rainbow gradients and bold black outlines.</p>\n<p>Pair the Super Graffiti font with playful character illustrations to create a complete world of fun. Whether you’re designing a YouTube banner or a school event poster, this font guarantees a “super” impact.</p>",
